/* @catalog — generated by `npm run catalog:generate`; do not edit by hand.
 * Internal
 *   Functions: opinion, aiResult, proxyResponse
 *   Constants: content
 * Tests
 *   - keeps proxy detail batches within the server protocol limit
 *   - publishes screening and in-flight progress before results, then commits concurrent batches monotonically
 *   - exposes Retry-After waits without advancing completed results
 *   - uses Luna structured outputs, includes parent context, and excludes author identity
 *   - uses authenticated Archtree proxy requests without sending an OpenAI key or author identity
 *   - retains comments for detailed analysis after refused, malformed or exhausted screening
 *   - pipelines full detail batches across sources before screening finishes, preserving per-item context
 *   - a 429 pauses every worker, halves permits, and restores slots only after sustained success
 *   - publishes exclusive cache, local exclusion, screening skip, and detail counters
 *   - overlapping 429 responses extend the shared deadline without reopening requests early
 *   - charges Decisions input and Responses cache writes at their distinct rates
 *   - confident screening skips avoid Responses calls entirely
 *   - retries transport failures and respects an HTTP-date Retry-After
 *   - retries Chrome fetch failures during proxy screening and detailed analysis
 *   - exhausted Chrome screening failures retain comments for detailed analysis after six requests
 *   - exhausted Chrome detail failures drain successful concurrent cache writes and reuse them on resume
 *   - does not retry programming errors or explicit aborts during proxy requests or response decoding
 *   - retries interrupted proxy response bodies without treating malformed JSON as a transport failure
 *   - retries a real Node proxy response interrupted after its headers arrive
 *   - quota exhaustion is not retried as a rate limit
 *   - splits exhausted proxy gateway failures without exceeding concurrency
 *   - drains concurrent cache writes before failing, stops new batches, and reuses saved results
 *   - persists a successful split half before a later half fails, then resumes without reclassifying it
 *   - fatal detail errors cancel queued permits and cooldowns while draining sent requests and cache writes
 * @end-catalog */

